Seted up the work enviornment with two virtual machines. 
  1. A Renmux VM that is meant to be used to examine and decypher the malware to be tested. 
  2. A Windows 10 VM with Flare VM installed on it. This one will be the main target in which we will detonate the malware to be analyzed. For safet, I've created two snapshots of this VM. One with the base Windos 10 installed and anoher one with the Flare VM installation. This two snapshots will function as safepoints / reset points for after working with malware. 


Finished the install and connected them to their own separate network.
